        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8 (4 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +2</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft. (4 squares)</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 19 (+1 size, +2 Agy, +5 breastplate, +1 buckler), touch 13, flat-footed 17</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +1/-3</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Short sword +2 melee (1d4/19-20) or flintlock pistol +4 ranged (2d6/x3)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> Short sword +2 melee (1d4/19-20) or flintlock pistol +4 ranged (2d6/x3)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 5 ft./5 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision, leper gnome traits</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +3, Ref +3, Will +0</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 10, Agy14, Sta 11, Int 12, Spt 9, Cha 8</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Climb -1, Craft (technological device) +3, Disable Device +3, Handle Animal +1, Intimidate +1, Listen +3, Open Lock +3, Spot +3, Jump -3</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Exotic Weapon Proficiency (firearms), Skilled (Listen and Spot)</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> Gnomeregan</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Solitary, troupe (2-4), attack squad (3-5 plus one 3rd-level sergeant), or cluster (10-20 plus 15% noncombatants plus two 3rd-level sergeants plus one 5th-level tinker)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> By character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
